  "probe": "r-cursor-1b/find-duplicates-sequence",
  "bookRefs": [
    "R-CURSOR-1",
    "D-CURSOR-1",
    "CUR-POS"
  ],
  "description": "On a dynaset over F, with the criteria shown, call in order and read NoMatch, BOF, EOF and ID after each: FindFirst/FindNext x2/FindPrevious x3/FindLast/FindPrevious x2/FindNext for \"N = 40\" (two rows share 40); FindFirst \"N = 40\", FindNext \"N >= 50\" x2, FindLast \"N <= 30\", FindPrevious \"N >= 10\" x2; FindFirst \"S Like 'a*'\" with FindNext x5; then Move 0, MoveFirst, FindNext \"N = 40\", MoveLast, FindPrevious \"N = 40\". Asks which duplicate each direction reaches, the effect of changing the criterion between calls, and the position after the last match. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
